  "content": {
    "id": "p26-q1-response",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Anh and Bindi have $\\$24$ between them. Anh gives Bindi $\\$2$, and they now have the same amount of money. How much money did they each originally have?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Anh had $\\$14$ and Bindi had $\\$10$.",
      "worked": "Let Anh originally have $x$ dollars and Bindi $y$ dollars.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x+y&=24 &&(1)\\\\x-2&=y+2\\\\x-y&=4 &&(2)\\\\2x&=28 &&(1)+(2)\\\\x&=14\\\\14+y&=24\\\\y&=10\\end{align*}$$\n\nAnh originally had $\\$14$ and Bindi $\\$10$. After the transfer, each has $\\$12$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 76
  },
